<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-asia</id><updated>2026-11-09T18:58:01Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-asia" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/s-12758?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-asia" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>Why Nvidia CEO's affair with alleged Chinese spy matters</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:97917e8351fd4d4d6b5bab658193f6e6a9f8907a46de1bcef6655fa2d04ab430</id><updated>2026-11-09T18:57:49Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T11:18:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/why-nvidia-ceo-s-affair-with-alleged-chinese-spy-matters/a-79898338--53b3557941e9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/why-nvidia-ceo-s-affair-with-alleged-chinese-spy-matters/a-79898338?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang has apologized for an affair with a woman the US believes was spying for China. The story could have profound implications for the world's most valuable company and the global AI race.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>India news:  Delhi air quality level 'severe' after Diwali</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4a4a4807abddf8db1ba3d46aa0c1fc4df1b18ab22ff88a68881f6c7ac4c69bf5</id><updated>2026-11-09T18:58:01Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T07:12:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-delhi-air-quality-level-severe-after-diwali/live-79895307--1403e23bf012.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-delhi-air-quality-level-severe-after-diwali/live-79895307?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Illegal fireworks during Diwali celebrations have impacted New Delhi's air quality level. DW has the latest.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Nvidia CEO Huang admits affair amid rumors of China spy ties</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d2c408ba8f7cefcdd99f55a8175b85d8b376f7923d5a1b8d7bfc2580410490ec</id><updated>2026-11-09T18:56:48Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T23:07:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nvidia-ceo-huang-admits-affair-amid-rumors-of-china-spy-ties/a-79894747--d2ac9a59ebd3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nvidia-ceo-huang-admits-affair-amid-rumors-of-china-spy-ties/a-79894747?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Following reports of Nvidia's chief Jensen Huang becoming involved with a Chinese spy, Huang offered an apology for cheating on his wife. Meanwhile, the US tech company pledged to investigate the alleged espionage.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India: Delhi chokes on most polluted Diwali eve in 10 years</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bde8502d9efb3362ab6d60bf98429da5bf9187794fb64bc81a48ef88656bcedd</id><updated>2026-11-09T18:56:48Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T07:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-delhi-chokes-on-most-polluted-diwali-eve-in-10-years/live-79883248--b4ed1b7f6c06.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-delhi-chokes-on-most-polluted-diwali-eve-in-10-years/live-79883248?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Delhi was ranked as the world's most polluted major city on the eve of Diwali. Delhi's air pollution is expected to get worse in the coming days.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>'No choice but to bear it': Delhi's unrelenting air pollution crisis</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:13585655ca57fd0a73bc41af6a3cb21b46e7bd0376c12a288b6df7fbb5a73b2c</id><updated>2026-11-09T18:56:48Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T12:05:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/no-choice-but-to-bear-it-delhi-s-unrelenting-air-pollution-crisis/a-79873124--aa42da1e16d2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/no-choice-but-to-bear-it-delhi-s-unrelenting-air-pollution-crisis/a-79873124?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Despite years of government interventions, emergency restrictions and public outrage, Delhi continues to battle dangerously polluted air every winter. Why isn't there a lasting solution to a predictable crisis?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Iran signals satisfaction, skepticism after US midterm vote</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:acf2be4288e34c6daed4513df1604169c5d33ce554783e3899963340e684e9ee</id><updated>2026-11-09T18:56:48Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T15:04:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/iran-signals-satisfaction-skepticism-after-us-midterm-vote/a-79867149--f14e22022dc8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/iran-signals-satisfaction-skepticism-after-us-midterm-vote/a-79867149?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">While the Iranian regime says the US midterms will not change Washington's policy toward Tehran, some officials and commentators see the resounding Democratic victory as blowback against the Iran war.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>South Korea tests Arctic shipping route amid Russia-West row</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1e02cc59e70ebebd98bbea286f5220e6bfcd25278e40bf5bf3d48cc22e763eda</id><updated>2026-11-09T18:56:48Z</updated><published>2026-11-05T09:45:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/south-korea-tests-arctic-shipping-route-amid-russia-west-row/a-79853907--d831b46c670a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/south-korea-tests-arctic-shipping-route-amid-russia-west-row/a-79853907?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="